# Local settings for `pnpm dev` (copy to .env.local) — a deployed site reads
# these from the environment's Orun secrets instead (component.yaml), pushed to
# the Worker after the build. Left empty, the page lists sample issues and says
# how to connect a GitHub App.
#
# The GitHub App: its ID, its private key (the .pem GitHub downloads, with
# newlines kept or written as \n), and the webhook secret you gave it.
GITHUB_APP_ID=""
GITHUB_APP_PK_PEM=""
GITHUB_WEBHOOK_SECRET=""
